# ========================================
# FILE STORAGE
# ========================================
# Files (licenses, prescriptions, medication images) are stored directly in
# PostgreSQL as base64 data URIs. No AWS S3 or any third-party storage needed.
# The existing String fields in the schema hold the data URI directly.
# AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID, AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY, AWS_S3_BUCKET are NOT required.

# ========================================
# FRONTEND URL (CORS)
# ========================================
